{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00221",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 4.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Hi, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.78,
      "end_seconds": 12.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "yes come in take a seat what can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.76,
      "end_seconds": 16.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "doctor, thank you for seeing us"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.64,
      "end_seconds": 20.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "So, please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.85,
      "end_seconds": 28.86,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "yeah it's leaking urine when I cough or sneeze i thought I'd wait but it hasn't gone"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.46,
      "end_seconds": 32.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Can I take your vitals now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.69,
      "end_seconds": 45.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Okay, almost there..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.7,
      "end_seconds": 65.56,
      "duration_seconds": 8.86,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.4, BP is 125 over 80, pulse is 80 beats a minute. And SpO2 98 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.0,
      "end_seconds": 68.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "is that alright doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.77,
      "end_seconds": 77.87,
      "duration_seconds": 8.1,
      "text": "so they help build the picture I'll tell you more soon. How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.85,
      "end_seconds": 81.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "probably six months. Yeah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.91,
      "end_seconds": 98.88,
      "duration_seconds": 12.97,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse. I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.57,
      "end_seconds": 126.15,
      "duration_seconds": 25.58,
      "text": "About a three out of ten. Laughing definitely sets it off. I did try to ignore it for a while. My sister suggested writing things down but I forgot. Oh and a heavy dragging feeling low down. That's been about the same about four days. With heavy dragging feeling low down about a seven out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.88,
      "end_seconds": 139.59,
      "duration_seconds": 12.71,
      "text": "as for urgent need to go sometimes, I honestly can't say when that began it might have been last month or the month before"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.14,
      "end_seconds": 143.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "is it mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.59,
      "end_seconds": 145.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "I'd call it moderate"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.2,
      "end_seconds": 153.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "have you been needing to wear a pad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.47,
      "end_seconds": 158.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "I mean, yeah. Two months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.7,
      "end_seconds": 161.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Would you call it mild or bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.26,
      "end_seconds": 166.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "I'd give it a five, out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.58,
      "end_seconds": 174.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "Have you had leaking urine when you cough or sneeze before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.75,
      "end_seconds": 181.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "A bit, last year. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.81,
      "end_seconds": 187.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "A few quick ones: blood in the urine difficulty emptying back pain or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.22,
      "end_seconds": 192.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "no, none of that at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.46,
      "end_seconds": 197.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.83,
      "end_seconds": 201.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "bowels are regular, nothing odd"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.8,
      "end_seconds": 209.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.69,
      "end_seconds": 212.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "no problems with breathing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.74,
      "end_seconds": 220.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.45,
      "end_seconds": 226.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "yes I had a a bypass operation six years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.58,
      "end_seconds": 238.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "What's your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.33,
      "end_seconds": 243.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "I teach at a primary school."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.56,
      "end_seconds": 247.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "okay, what's your diet like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.01,
      "end_seconds": 253.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "I eat out quite a lot, to be honest"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.45,
      "end_seconds": 258.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Tell me what you take day to day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.54,
      "end_seconds": 264.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "I take Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.23,
      "end_seconds": 267.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "when did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.11,
      "end_seconds": 280.53,
      "duration_seconds": 12.42,
      "text": "about about a month it's losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day for my blood pressure it's clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.87,
      "end_seconds": 302.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Tell me about your health in general, any ongoing conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.16,
      "end_seconds": 319.56,
      "duration_seconds": 12.4,
      "text": "Diabetes for five years i have high blood pressure for two years i told myself I'd wait and see and here I am i've got heart disease"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.43,
      "end_seconds": 326.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "alright, diabetes and high blood pressure, that matches what I have here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.52,
      "end_seconds": 332.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "let's do the physical part now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.07,
      "end_seconds": 336.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.02,
      "end_seconds": 349.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "No bulge is visible when you cough, and the tummy is soft."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 351.86,
      "end_seconds": 352.81,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.03,
      "end_seconds": 366.97,
      "duration_seconds": 10.94,
      "text": "okay finished. Putting it all together I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be stress urinary incontinence or it might be an overactive bladder"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.68,
      "end_seconds": 371.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.25,
      "end_seconds": 382.03,
      "duration_seconds": 9.78,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's stress urinary incontinence and we'll know more once the a urine test is back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 389.83,
      "end_seconds": 424.62,
      "duration_seconds": 34.79,
      "text": "I want a urine test done, that's for urinary leakage. I want a bladder diary done, that's for urinary symptoms. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. Pelvic floor exercises, three sets a day, make a real difference over a couple of months. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. Let's review you in eight weeks. Right, that's all. Go gently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 425.59,
      "end_seconds": 427.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Thank you for your time."
    }
  ]
}